# Project images

Replace the three placeholder SVG files with your own screenshots. You may keep the same filenames, or update each `image` value in `projects.js`.

Recommended image size: 1200 × 750 pixels (16:10 ratio).

- `iris-flower-classification.svg`
- `penguin-data-analysis.svg`
- `customer-behavior-analysis.svg`

Good choices include a final chart, model result, cluster visualization, or analysis overview. Avoid screenshots that show only raw code.
